HATMAGICIAN2-PURIFYING_LIGHT.description:
[color=#d5fff5]Color: Cleanse all debuffs from All creatures.[/color]
For each debuff cleansed, gain {Block:diff()} Block, and allies gain half as much. {InCombat:
(Cleanse {PurifyingLight} effects)|}

HATMAGICIAN2-INDIFFERENCE.description:
[color=#d5fff5]Color: Apply {Hat2Var:diff()} [gold]Gloomy[/gold] to ALL enemies.[/color]
Gain Block equal to the total [gold]Gloomy[/gold] stacks on ALL enemies. {InCombat:
(Gain {Indifference:diff()} Block)|}

HATMAGICIAN2-SUBMERGENCE.description:
Apply 1 additional [gold]Gloomy[/gold] for every 3 stacks of [gold]Gloomy[/gold] the enemy has.
[color=#d5fff5]Color: Apply {Hat2Var:diff()} additional stacks.[/color]{InCombat:
(Apply {SubmergenceShow:diff()} stacks)|}
